## S0 Welcome and the export guide (FR-49).

welcome-eyebrow = For your Snapchat Memories export
welcome-title = Put the dates and places back into your memories
welcome-lede = { -product } repairs the Memories export you downloaded from Snapchat, here on this computer. Your photos and videos come out sorted by date, with their capture time and location inside, so your photo library shows them on the right day and on the map.
welcome-value-dates = Capture dates and locations written into every photo and video
welcome-value-captions = Captions and stickers added back, with the originals kept
welcome-value-library = A tidy library in year and month folders
welcome-value-private = Nothing is uploaded: no Snapchat login, no account
welcome-get-started = Get started

